{
  "title": "Ziyarat of the Wives of the Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.)",
  "data": "At the graves of the Prophet's wives in al-Baqi, recite:\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُنَّ يَا زَوْجَاتِ رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKUNNA YAA ZAWJAATI RASOOLILLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O wives of the Messenger of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُنَّ يَا زَوْجَاتِ نَبِيِّ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKUNNA YAA ZAWJAATI NABIYYILLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O wives of the Prophet of Allah,\nاُمَّهَاتِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ وَرَحْمَةُ اللّٰهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهٗ\nUMMAHAATIL MU'MINEENA WA RAHMATULLAAHI WA BARAKAATUH\nmothers of the believers, and the mercy of Allah and His blessings.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ ارْضَ عَنْهُنَّ وَارْفَعْ دَرَجَاتِهِنَّ\nALLAAHUMMAR DA A'NHUNNA WARFA' DARAJAATIHINN\nO Allah, be pleased with them and raise their ranks,\nوَاَكْرِمْ مَقَامَهُنَّ وَاَجْزِلْ ثَوَابَهُنَّ\nWA AKRIM MAQAAMAHUNNA WA AJZIL THAWAABAHUNN\nhonour their station and make their reward abundant.\nاٰمِيْنَ يَا رَبَّ الْعَالَمِيْنَ\nAAMEENA YAA RABBAL A'ALAMEEN\nAmen, O Lord of the worlds.",
  "merits": "Most of the wives of the Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.), among them Umm Salamah, are buried in al-Baqi. Lady Khadijah (s.a.) is buried in Makkah ([Ziyarat of Lady Khadijah al-Kubra (s.a.)](AQ5)), and Maymunah at Sarif, near Makkah. The Quran calls the Prophet's wives the mothers of the believers (33:6).\n\nThis ziyarat is given in Shia pilgrims' guides to al-Baqi without a narrated source."
}
